        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: South Australian Brewing Company, Kent Town Brewery, West End Brewery\n- People: Sir Edwin Thomas Smith, W. K. Simms\n- Roles: brewer, businessman, councillor, mayor, politician, benefactor\n\nFacts:\n- Sir Edwin Thomas Smith was born on 6 April 1830 and died on 25 December 1919.\n- Sir Edwin Thomas Smith was an English-born South Australian brewer, businessman, councillor, mayor, politician, and benefactor.\n- The South Australian Brewing Company, Limited, was established in 1888.\n- The South Australian Brewing Company, Limited, was formed by amalgamating Sir Edwin Thomas Smith's Kent Town Brewery with W. K. Simms's West End Brewery.",
